{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2072086152249737294","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:33:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2072086034339541159","2072086152249737294"],"id":"2072086152249737294","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2367,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"睡三个小时我的心情如奶油般化开…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2072086152249737294"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2072086034339541159","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:33:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2072086034339541159","2072086152249737294"],"id":"2072086034339541159","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":19,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"睡三个小时我的心情如奶油般化…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2072086034339541159"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071989111641219348","created_at":"2026-06-30T16:07:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071989111641219348"],"id":"2071989111641219348","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"朋友倾诉的时候总会突然打住，说着好像浪费你的时间了一类的话就把一团乱麻推回喉咙咽下去，连自己面对别人脆弱的权利的咀嚼掉了。讲过那么多遍的故事，生活依然没有变好一点点，最后连倾诉这件事本身都成为了一种困扰。我想我不是一个好的倾听者也不能帮你消减些日积月累的痛苦。可是好朋友如果你会后悔说了那么多，那我就保证自己绝对不后悔听你说了那么那么多"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":6116,"like_count":101,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":13},"text":"朋友倾诉的时候总会突然打住，说着好像浪费你的时间了一类的话就把一团乱麻推回喉咙咽下去，连自己面对别人脆弱的权利的咀嚼掉了。讲过那么多遍的故事，生活依然没有变好一点点，最后连倾诉这件事本身都成为了一种困扰。我想我不是一个好的倾听者也不能帮你消减些日积月累的痛苦。可是好朋友如果你会后","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071989111641219348"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071973776057901496","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:06:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071973776057901496"],"id":"2071973776057901496","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":83394,"like_count":1753,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":55,"retweet_count":129},"text":"我现在想成为一个破了洞的避孕套，整体活着没什么意义，但能随机毁掉三个人的生活","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071973776057901496"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071972737959223668","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:02:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071972737959223668"],"id":"2071972737959223668","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":5354,"like_count":72,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我就像根吊 进入你的生活里 因为不够大 所以离开的时候你也没什么感觉","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071972737959223668"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071972266204962820","created_at":"2026-06-30T15:00:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071972266204962820"],"id":"2071972266204962820","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":8536,"like_count":64,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":7},"text":"大师，我不要桃花了，我要钱花","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071972266204962820"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071970463782494708","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:53:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071970463782494708"],"id":"2071970463782494708","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2979,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":2},"text":"其实对于我前夫在我心里的地位应该是已经死掉了，因为他永远不会回来，只是一个小亡魂","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071970463782494708"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071969789246120198","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:51:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071969789246120198"],"id":"2071969789246120198","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2247,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"唉至少在我emo成这样的时候点开推特主页还有片可以看","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071969789246120198"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071969640805462148","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:50:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071969640805462148"],"id":"2071969640805462148","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":56980,"like_count":769,"quote_count":11,"reply_count":180,"retweet_count":109},"text":"一到晚上要么抑郁要么想色情的东西","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071969640805462148"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071968091949646189","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:44:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071968091949646189"],"id":"2071968091949646189","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3107,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"过去又过不去是不是源自于我没承认过舍不得。\n承认就能走出去吗。也未必见得。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071968091949646189"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071966997693534320","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:40:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071966997693534320"],"id":"2071966997693534320","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":6911,"like_count":131,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":29},"text":"我一闲下来就会想到你 然后我就去刷视频刷到别人特别幸福的视频时我还是会想到你 但是我想的不是我们是你和别人 你以后会和别人那样 幸福的让所有人羡慕 那些是你跟我在一起时我没有的 我会恨你一辈子的我真的会的…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071966997693534320"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071965142829650222","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:32:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071965142829650222"],"id":"2071965142829650222","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3959,"like_count":43,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我发现  当我压力过载时。心情会格外的平静….已经失去紧张感了，淡淡的冷静","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071965142829650222"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071961434276401394","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:17:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071961434276401394"],"id":"2071961434276401394","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2716,"like_count":49,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实我最喜欢的还是一方牵着另一方的手说走吧我带你去看我生活过的地方","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071961434276401394"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071959415771877701","created_at":"2026-06-30T14:09:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071959415771877701"],"id":"2071959415771877701","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":6069,"like_count":115,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":8},"text":"很想说一些小宝不要对自己道德要求太严格了，就算是勇者也会挨家挨户抢劫村民宝箱","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071959415771877701"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071955930074472823","created_at":"2026-06-30T13:56:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071955930074472823"],"id":"2071955930074472823","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":17284,"like_count":79,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":47,"retweet_count":6},"text":"想我就说，不要每次都弄的满手都是","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071955930074472823"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071954507697893468","created_at":"2026-06-30T13:50:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071954507697893468"],"id":"2071954507697893468","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2434,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我总要留下一些你爱我的痕迹。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071954507697893468"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071951312049352969","created_at":"2026-06-30T13:37:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071951312049352969"],"id":"2071951312049352969","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2950,"like_count":58,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":10},"text":"其实我更恨的是明知道这一切但是又舍不得放下的我自己……","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071951312049352969"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071815738474828203","created_at":"2026-06-30T04:38:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071815738474828203"],"id":"2071815738474828203","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":4773,"like_count":89,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":12},"text":"其实对于一些“痛苦”时刻我的接受度是很高的，比如双手都拎满了东西行李爬楼梯；比如饿着肚子冒着雨却要去做什么事情。但是在人声鼎沸周边都喧闹的时候、晚风和煦月亮高挂的时候，一个人突然就失落到难过到说不出话了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071815738474828203"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071612956807487887","created_at":"2026-06-29T15:13:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071612956807487887"],"id":"2071612956807487887","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":5672,"like_count":63,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":13},"text":"我的未来竟然取决于我自己。就不能找个更靠谱的人来负责吗？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071612956807487887"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071607102695780751","created_at":"2026-06-29T14:49:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071607102695780751"],"id":"2071607102695780751","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4921,"like_count":69,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":11},"text":"可是你把我当勾勾手指就过去的一条狗我不都认了吗？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071607102695780751"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071605058257776710","created_at":"2026-06-29T14:41:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071605058257776710"],"id":"2071605058257776710","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3241,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":3},"text":"爱到底是什么？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071605058257776710"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071604480647614867","created_at":"2026-06-29T14:39:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2071604480647614867"],"id":"2071604480647614867","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3172,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":0},"text":"三秒钟，足够爱上一个人了，不是吗？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2071604480647614867"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2071604310128124304","created_at":"2026-06-29T14:38:50.000Z","edit_